<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>LeverageScales | Leverage, engineered.</title>
<meta name="description" content="LeverageScales is a private consultancy for professionals and creators who intend to scale.">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#09090b">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://leveragescales.com/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="LeverageScales">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://leveragescales.com/">
<meta property="og:title" content="LeverageScales | Leverage, engineered.">
<meta property="og:description" content="A private consultancy for professionals and creators who intend to scale.">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%2309090b'/%3E%3Cpath d='M5 22L27 10' stroke='%23818cf8' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3Cpath d='M16 16.5l-5 9h10z' fill='%2334d399'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#09090b;--surface:#121216;--border:#27272a;--text:#fafafa;--muted:#a1a1aa;--indigo:#4f46e5;--indigo-hi:#818cf8;--emerald:#34d399}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body,h1,p{margin:0}
html{color-scheme:dark}
body{min-height:100vh;min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--emerald);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{width:min(100% - 2.5rem,1120px);margin-inline:auto}

header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;height:72px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.brand svg{width:28px;height:28px;flex:none}
.brand span{color:var(--indigo-hi)}

main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:1.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;text-align:center}
.lever{display:block;width:min(100%,420px);height:auto;margin-bottom:2.25rem}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,4.2rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.lead{max-width:34ch;margin-top:1.1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem}
.build{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;margin-top:2rem;padding:.45rem 1rem;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:99px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--emerald)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:1.75rem;padding:.9rem 1.6rem;background:var(--indigo);border-radius:10px;color:#fff;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1;transition:background .2s}
.btn:hover{background:#4338ca}
.addr{margin-top:.9rem;color:#71717a;font-size:.85rem}

.beam{transform-box:view-box;transform-origin:130px 150px;transform:rotate(7deg);animation:tilt 2.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) .4s both}
@keyframes tilt{from{transform:rotate(0deg)}}

footer{padding:1.75rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;text-align:center}
footer a:hover{color:var(--text)}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="LeverageScales home">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="#121216" stroke="#27272a"/><path d="M6 22L26 11" stroke="#818cf8" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 16.5l-4.5 8h9z" fill="#34d399"/></svg>
      Leverage<span>Scales</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <svg class="lever" viewBox="0 0 400 220" role="img" aria-label="A lever where a small effort on the long arm lifts a larger load">
    <line x1="20" y1="196" x2="380" y2="196" stroke="#27272a" stroke-width="2"/>
    <path d="M130 150l-24 46h48z" fill="#18181b" stroke="#3f3f46" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <g class="beam">
      <line x1="30" y1="150" x2="372" y2="150" stroke="#818cf8" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="58" cy="122" r="24" fill="#34d399"/>
      <circle cx="350" cy="138" r="10" fill="#fafafa"/>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <h1>Leverage, engineered.</h1>
  <p class="lead">A private consultancy for professionals and creators who intend to scale.</p>
  <p class="build"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Building in progress</p>
  <a class="btn" href="mailto:contact@leveragescales.com?subject=Hello%20LeverageScales">Get in touch</a>
  <p class="addr">contact@leveragescales.com</p>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">© 2026 LeverageScales &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="https://leveragescales.com">leveragescales.com</a></div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
